  "notes": [
    "Owner requests merging saved bottom-right branch with G42 and surrounding artifacts, using H9 and available wide captures. G38 → G37 → G36 → G35 order and original four-block placements are retained.",
    "H9 normal/wide places G42 across the stair/escalator void from the blue seating row. In this composition G42 rotates +90 at [-5,0,10.2]; its local furniture transforms, IDs and dimensions remain intact.",
    "Owner correction aligns the stair start beside G37 (third bay from bottom) and its end beside G35 (first). The stair opening reaches the continuous H2 outer wall, replacing the earlier inset wall and gap. Only the left landing connects the rows. Drop, widths and tread count remain provisional.",
    "Visible context includes pale lobby walls, checker inlay, stone/brass console with schematic vases/ring ornament, closed lift doors, plants, waste bins, sanitizer and extinguisher. Exact patterns, brands, small props and lower-floor seating remain unresolved rather than assigned invented identities.",
    "The original bottom-right-only URL remains available. This enlarged layout owns the added lobby context and shared void boundaries; furniture can be edited in each source block. Camera registration is unchanged, and H9 keeps its blank group.",
    "All 20 seat slots and six external table identities load once from the five source blocks. Dimensions, artifact identity, relative alignment, floor elevation and broader building calibration remain review items.",
    "Owner perimeter completion: the H2 outer wall continues to the lower lobby corner at X=2.65, Z=15.35. The lift wall/attached fixtures and console return align to that edge; floor infill closes the outer strip beside the stairwell.",
    "Latest owner correction removes the duplicate inner stair-end wall and gap. The stair/escalator opening ends at X=2.57, the inside face of the outer wall at X=2.65; no lower landing projects beyond the exterior."
  ],
